no al nazista Franz Liebkind (Will Ferrell), scrittore del copione scelto, il ruolo del Führer per mettere in scena il peggior musical di sempre. Ma il loro attore protagonista si ferisce e il suo ruolo viene interpretato dal regista gay. Quindi il musical appare al pubblico satirico e spiritoso: gli investitori pretendono quindi i loro soldi costringendo Leo alla fuga a Rio de Janeiro con i soldi e la fidanzata Ulla (Uma Thurman) e facendo finire Bialystock in prigione."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"A conniving Broadway producer and his meek accountant plan to profit from charming wealthy old biddies to invest in an overbudget production, and then put on a sure-fire disaster, so nobody will ask for their money back — and what's more disastrous than a tasteless musical celebrating Adolf Hitler.","tagline":"They had everything to gain by not being a success!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xomTXhaGeB2nHJCKU37gCvL82hc.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8PU4tUGUdrKujKwkUkw3M9ZrAaw.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":9899,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xomTXhaGeB2nHJCKU37gCvL82hc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xomTXhaGeB2nHJCKU37gCvL82hc.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1800},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xomTXhaGeB2nHJCKU37gCvL82hc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xomTXhaGeB2nHJCKU37gCvL82hc.jpg","language":"it","width":1200,"height":1800},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ofKrUq64QJpAAx44jvYBTogGrpC.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ofKrUq64QJpAAx44jvYBTogGrpC.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/o